    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like love though. it just feels like i'm dragging them down into this hole with me. they'd have so much more space to just... breathe and be happy if i wasn't constantly struggling and making everything so complicated. i feel like if i could just get out of the way, they'd finally have a chance.",
