      "content": "but what if the \"hope\" is just a lie i tell myself to keep dragging them through this? i look at them and all i see is how much my struggle is costing them. it feels selfish to keep holding on when my existence just keeps making their lives harder. wouldn't it actually be more selfless to just let them go and see if they can finally thrive without my mess holding them back?",
